  <p class="lead-para">
    <strong>ERP and business technology consulting careers help organisations set up and improve the systems that run finance, sales, supply chain and people processes, and they reward process understanding, clear documentation and patient communication with users.</strong> The decisions that unlock high income opportunities include choosing a branch early and building a high-income skill portfolio of finished work, because AI can handle routine tasks but cannot take responsibility for your results.
  </p>

